{"data":[{"author_id":"1378320364376219655","created_at":"2026-10-20T03:41:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112388587584934088"],"id":"2112388587584934088","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1702,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"央行9月金融数据整体喜忧参半。社融同比多增，企业中长期贷款改善，政策托底效果显现，但居民房贷、消费贷款依旧偏弱。M2维持9.3%，市场流动性充足，M1增速低迷，居民存款单月大增，大家存钱意愿很强，内需内生动力不足。LPR下调压低融资成本，资金真正流入实体还需要时间。债市偏利好，股市要看盈利兑","url":"https://x.com/WangNextDoor2/status/2112388587584934088"},{"author_id":"1612084663778181122","created_at":"2026-10-21T13:26:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112898227498520934"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":125,"start":122,"tag":"融資"},{"end":137,"start":127,"tag":"お金貸してください"}]},"id":"2112898227498520934","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2391,"like_count":21,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":30,"retweet_count":0},"text":"個人融資でも会社融資でもお金を貸していただける方探してます。\n\n今月中にかなりな額が必要になり本当に困ってます。\nお借りしたお金はしっかり返します。\n身分証明書なども送ること可能です。\n\n本当に助けて欲しいです。\n\nよろしくお願いします。\n\n #融資\n #お金貸してください","url":"https://x.com/PS4aCFjxGgtQywT/status/2112898227498520934"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112374222110777344"]},"author_id":"1749453907703767040","created_at":"2026-10-20T02:43:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112374232965697858"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/kWISuf5XvS","end":164,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/ChinaMacroFacts/status/2112374232965697858/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112374222110777344","start":141,"url":"https://t.co/kWISuf5XvS"},{"display_url":"x.com/chinamacrofact…","end":188,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/chinamacrofacts/status/1803610877335093277","start":165,"url":"https://t.co/GGkqnaNhYS"}]},"id":"2112374232965697858","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":64,"impression_count":43785,"like_count":115,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":25,"retweet_count":16},"text":"时隔两年多，潘功胜终于完成了货币政策框架上从数量型到价格型的阶段性里程碑。\n\n这个框架的转变是制度性的，不应期待对货币政策有直接的短期的影响，属于与全球主要央行的操作框架接轨。\n\n未来货币政策将不再给出社融和基础货币供应的的目标区间，长期看房贷可能也将逐渐和国债接轨—和美国一致。 https://t.co/kWISuf5XvS https://t.co/GGkqnaNhYS","url":"https://x.com/ChinaMacroFacts/status/2112374232965697858"},{"author_id":"1962846462","created_at":"2026-10-21T03:08:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112742909619610036"],"id":"2112742909619610036","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":40,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"郵便局昼休みずらせよって話題あるけど\nそれやったら昼過ぎからくるトラックの対応とかする人おらんくなるとかになるだけじゃない？\n郵便局のデカさにもよるかもしれんけど\n\nなにより、10年前まで10年くらい配達してたもんとしては\nあんなだんだん人減ってきてる全国規模の会社\n融通きくわけないだろ💦","url":"https://x.com/niiyanda/status/2112742909619610036"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112809165748047872"]},"author_id":"1306482858010140672","created_at":"2026-10-21T07:32:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112809177479319868"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/3YV0UGdgHR","end":168,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/VICOINDAO/status/2112809177479319868/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112809165748047872","start":145,"url":"https://t.co/3YV0UGdgHR"}]},"id":"2112809177479319868","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":75,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"增速目标往下调，这事其实没那么玄乎。几十年双位数跑下来，现在落到4%出头，不是谁踩了刹车，是路本身变窄了。图表摆在那，出口、地产两条腿都在换节奏。比如出口，加入WTO后有过年均20%以上的扩张期，那时候外需像一条宽跑道；如今全球贸易增速放缓、产业链在重组，单月出口数据经常被春节错位、基数 https://t.co/3YV0UGdgHR","url":"https://x.com/VICOINDAO/status/2112809177479319868"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112699126303621120"]},"author_id":"706951681565663232","created_at":"2026-10-21T00:15:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112699133551415520"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"wind.com.cn/portal/en/Insi…","end":268,"expanded_url":"https://www.wind.com.cn/portal/en/Insights/insightsDetail.html?id=7E7E9A74B1840656694A717CB2691E89","start":245,"status":200,"title":"Wind Insights","unwound_url":"https://www.wind.com.cn/portal/en/Insights/insightsDetail.html?id=7E7E9A74B1840656694A717CB2691E89","url":"https://t.co/QSCg9tWfz1"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/cYZZbh07YN","end":292,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/WindInfoUS/status/2112699133551415520/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112699126303621120","start":269,"url":"https://t.co/cYZZbh07YN"}]},"id":"2112699133551415520","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":88,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Wind Financial Morning Post: October 21, 2026\nNDRC speeds up domestic demand plan; \nPBOC runs 9-day overnight reverse repos;\nMOFCOM responds to US sanctions on Chinese firms; \nLPR unchanged for 17 months; \nNational Data Group set up in Xiong'an\nhttps://t.co/QSCg9tWfz1 https://t.co/cYZZbh07YN","url":"https://x.com/WindInfoUS/status/2112699133551415520"},{"author_id":"1796323617036234752","created_at":"2026-10-20T03:36:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112387415151173917"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":19,"start":4,"tag":"monetarypolicy"},{"end":26,"start":20,"tag":"China"},{"end":32,"start":27,"tag":"PBoC"}]},"id":"2112387415151173917","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"❗️🇨🇳#monetarypolicy #China #PBoC China: 1Y LPR = 3% (exp./prev. 3%), 5Y LPR = 3.50% (exp./prev. 3.50%)\n\nRates unchanged for the 17th straight month.\n\nNo surprise: Beijing still prefers targeted support over broad cuts, and a firm yuan leaves room to ease later.","url":"https://x.com/KevinMorr1s/status/2112387415151173917"},{"author_id":"2013688467142606848","created_at":"2026-10-20T03:34:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112387005497725003"],"id":"2112387005497725003","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":44,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Çin Merkez Bankası Faiz Kararı\n\n🔹 Çin Merkez Bankası, 1 yıllık kredi ana faiz oranını LPR beklentilere paralel şekilde %3,00 seviyesinde sabit tuttu.\n\n🔹 Konut kredileri açısından referans niteliğindeki 5 yıllık LPR de beklentilere paralel %3,50 seviyesinde değişmedi.\n\n🔹 PBoC","url":"https://x.com/traderselman/status/2112387005497725003"},{"author_id":"3137643480","created_at":"2026-10-20T10:41:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112494345303801928"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":10,"start":0,"tag":"גירויסיני"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/LiveSquawk/sta…","end":294,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/LiveSquawk/status/2112348281682726982","start":271,"url":"https://t.co/ulo4Yx5U3D"}]},"id":"2112494345303801928","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":348,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"#גירויסיני ריבית פריים אוקטובר: \nסין שמרה על ריביות הפריים על הלוואות במשך החודש ה-17, כאשר המדיניות עוברת לריביות לטווח קצר\nריבית רוורס ריפו ל - 7 ימים של PBOC, שעומדת על 1.4%, היא ריבית המדיניות העיקרית מאז 2024, כשהריבית LPR הולכת בעקבותיה במקום לשמש כמנוף בפני עצמו. https://t.co/ulo4Yx5U3D","url":"https://x.com/TheRealYield/status/2112494345303801928"},{"author_id":"1910955926594740226","created_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112534571757847023"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":168,"start":162,"tag":"China"},{"end":174,"start":169,"tag":"PBOC"},{"end":190,"start":175,"tag":"ChineseEconomy"},{"end":205,"start":191,"tag":"InterestRates"},{"end":219,"start":206,"tag":"AsianMarkets"},{"end":234,"start":220,"tag":"GlobalFinance"},{"end":242,"start":235,"tag":"Stocks"},{"end":253,"start":243,"tag":"Economics"}]},"id":"2112534571757847023","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":16,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"🇨🇳 CHINA HELD ITS KEY LENDING RATES STEADY AGAIN.\n\n1-year LPR: 3.00%\n5-year LPR: 3.50%\n\nWith Q3 growth at 4.5%, Beijing may see less urgency for fresh stimulus.\n\n#China #PBOC #ChineseEconomy #InterestRates #AsianMarkets #GlobalFinance #Stocks #Economics","url":"https://x.com/Investwithkabir/status/2112534571757847023"},{"author_id":"1910955926594740226","created_at":"2026